{"story":{"id":"event-colony-mod-161","title":{"zh":"磁力奇迹","en":"Magnetic Miracle"},"category":"society","kind":"event","image":"art/6b820a05f6f9571130a4.webp","start":"colony_mod.16","chapters":24,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"[Root.GetName]周围的强力磁场最近在影响地面上的电脑。奇怪的是，这个影响并不是单纯地随机干扰，正相反，电脑实际上比预想中运行的更有效率了。这简直是老天相助……","en":"The Strong Magnetic Field around [Root.GetName] has been affecting computers on the surface recently. Oddly, this effect is not merely random interference, instead computers are actually working more efficiently than they should be. It's almost as if an outsid"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n4","n6","n11","n21","n25","n26"]},"n1":{"doc":"colony_mod.16","parent":"n0","via":{"chance":0.5,"group":"c3273","delay":[{"days":"30","random":"90"}],"hooks":["immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"has_modifier","arg":"strong_magnetic_field","scope":"","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"has_modifier","arg":"magnetic_research_boost","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"has_modifier","arg":"magnetic_disruption","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"has_ground_combat","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"pop_amount","arg":"0","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"entry","source":"events/colony_events_3.txt:952","triggers":[{"zh":"由游戏状态触发","en":"Triggered by game state"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"special_projects:MAGNETIC_PLANET_RESEARCH_PROJECT","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"FASCINATING","optionIndex":0,"group":"c3271","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"which","arg":"magnetic_planet_research","scope":"check_variable","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"value","arg":"3","scope":"check_variable","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/colony_events_3.txt:812"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"colony_mod.18","parent":"n2","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:682"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"colony_mod.1